#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:legal_request.field_legal_request_category__default_target_kind
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:legal_request.view_legal_request_category_search
msgid "Usually Becomes"
msgstr "يتحوّل عادة إلى"

#. module: legal_request
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:legal_request.view_legal_request_form
msgid "Wait On External"
msgstr "بانتظار جهة خارجية"

#. module: legal_request
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:legal_request.view_legal_request_form
msgid "Wait On Requester"
msgstr "بانتظار مقدّم الطلب"

#. module: legal_request
#: model:ir.model.fields.selection,name:legal_request.selection__legal_request__state__waiting_external
msgid "Waiting On External Body"
msgstr "بانتظار جهة خارجية"

#. module: legal_request
#: model:ir.model.fields.selection,name:legal_request.selection__legal_request__state__waiting_requester
msgid "Waiting On Requester"
msgstr "بانتظار مقدّم الطلب"

#. module: legal_request
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/legal_request/models/legal_request.py:0
msgid "Waiting on an external body to respond."
msgstr "بانتظار رد جهة خارجية."

#. module: legal_request
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/legal_request/models/legal_request.py:0
msgid "Waiting on the requester for further information."
msgstr "بانتظار مقدّم الطلب لمزيد من المعلومات."

#. module: legal_request
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:legal_request.field_legal_request__category_id
msgid ""
"What class of request this is. Drives the triage desk's first guess at what "
"it will become."
msgstr "صنف هذا الطلب. يوجّه تخمين مكتب الفرز الأول لما سيتحوّل إليه."

#. module: legal_request
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:legal_request.field_legal_request__decision
msgid "What the approver decided. Recorded by the approval dialog."
msgstr "ما قرّره المصادِق. يُسجّله مربّع حوار المصادقة."

#. module: legal_request
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:legal_request.view_legal_request_return_form
msgid "What the approver wants changed, in their words."
msgstr "ما يريد المصادِق تغييره بكلماته."

#. module: legal_request
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:legal_request.field_legal_request_return__reason
msgid ""
"What the approver wants changed, in their words. This is what the rework is "
"corrected against, so “redo it” is not an answer."
msgstr ""
"ما يريد المصادِق تغييره بكلماته. عليه يُصحَّح العمل المُعاد، فـ«أعِده» ليست "
"إجابة."

#. module: legal_request
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:legal_request.view_legal_request_form
msgid "What the department answered."
msgstr "ما أجابت به الدائرة."

#. module: legal_request
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:legal_request.field_legal_request__response
msgid ""
"What the department answered. Filled in as the officer works and frozen at "
"approval."
msgstr "ما أجابت به الدائرة. يُكتب أثناء عمل الموظف ويُجمَّد عند المصادقة."

#. module: legal_request
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:legal_request.field_legal_request_category__name
msgid ""
"What the department calls this class of request, e.g. Legal Consultation."
msgstr "ما تسمّي به الدائرة هذا الصنف من الطلبات، مثل: استشارة قانونية."

#. module: legal_request
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:legal_request.field_legal_request__target_response_date
msgid ""
"When the department has undertaken to respond. Lateness is measured against "
"this."
msgstr "الموعد الذي تعهّدت الدائرة بالرد فيه. يُقاس التأخر عليه."

#. module: legal_request
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:legal_request.field_legal_request__entity_id
msgid "Which of the company's legal entities the request concerns."
msgstr "أيّ الكيانات القانونية للشركة يخصّه الطلب."

#. module: legal_request
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:legal_request.view_legal_request_cancel_form
msgid "Why the request is being dropped."
msgstr "سبب إسقاط الطلب."

#. module: legal_request
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:legal_request.field_legal_request_cancel__reason
msgid ""
"Why the request is being dropped. The requester will ask, and so will the "
"auditor."
msgstr "سبب إسقاط الطلب. سيسأل مقدّمه، وسيسأل المدقّق."

